# LF in the working tree on every platform (2026-09-28, the outsider drill).
#
# The bundle is built FROM the working tree and runs on Linux. Git for
# Windows installs with core.autocrlf=true, so without this a fresh clone
# there had CRLF in every file, and a bundle built from it failed its first
# command on Linux with "/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory".
# Every file in the repository is already stored LF; this only stops a
# checkout from converting it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
